SSH(PowerShell) 접속 후:

```bash
sudo apt update
sudo apt upgrade -y
```

필수 패키지 설치

```bash
sudo apt install \
python3 \
python3-pip \
python3-venv \
sqlite3 \
libffi-dev \
libssl-dev \
autoconf \
build-essential \
libopenjp2-7 \
libtiff6 \
libturbojpeg0-dev \
tzdata -y
```

Home Assistant 사용자 생성

```bash
sudo useradd -rm homeassistant
```

설치 폴더 생성

```bash
sudo mkdir /srv/homeassistant
sudo chown homeassistant:homeassistant /srv/homeassistant
```

Home Assistant 설치

```bash
sudo -u homeassistant -H -s
```

```bash
cd /srv/homeassistant

python3 -m venv .

source bin/activate

pip install wheel

pip install homeassistant
```

실행

```bash
hass
```
